  'نهائيا ولا يمكن التراجع تحفظ فواتيره وسنداته كسجل مالي لكن دون نسبتها إليه وتحذف بياناته التشغيلية مخزون السيارة المواقع الزيارات': { en: 'will be permanently deleted and this cannot be undone. His invoices and receipts are kept as a financial record but are no longer attributed to him, and his operational data is deleted: van stock, locations, visits', fr: 'sera définitivement supprimé et cette action est irréversible. Ses factures et reçus sont conservés comme registre financier mais ne lui sont plus attribués, et ses données opérationnelles sont supprimées : stock du véhicule, positions, visites', tr: 'kalıcı olarak silinecek ve geri alınamaz. Faturaları ve tahsilat makbuzları mali kayıt olarak saklanır ancak ona bağlanmaz, operasyonel verileri silinir: araç stoğu, konumlar, ziyaretler', zh: '将被永久删除，无法撤销。其发票与收款单作为财务记录保留但不再归属于他，运营数据将被删除：车辆库存、位置、拜访' },
